      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_e9f7998890357d38248abb4de93fa48d54b3f94eb9bbcd01822c794cd014accd"
      ],
      "text": "muAgent is described as an agent framework driven by LLM and an Eventic Knowledge Graph (EKG), combining MultiAgent, FunctionCall, and CodeInterpreter techniques."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_8c8ab0c9e300d9e9bee06e9c3231f2fd7e26459c10d13e39c4807fab79279994",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "ebc8c3fbc886969befb6be18d4f85787de29b086",
          "git_sha": "8516fd8b7afbab3a6fce21e20612d01f94c0b83b",
          "line_end": 45,
          "line_start": 39,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "codefuse-ai/codefuse-muagent",
          "url": "https://github.com/codefuse-ai/CodeFuse-muAgent/blob/ebc8c3fbc886969befb6be18d4f85787de29b086/README.md#L39-L45"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_e9f7998890357d38248abb4de93fa48d54b3f94eb9bbcd01822c794cd014accd"
      ],
      "text": "The framework advertises four core differentiating capabilities: Complex Reasoning, Online Collaboration, Human Interaction, and Knowledge On-demand."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_0c88f05352da0628a8535e95eb6b0ff4a79e2a7ef7ecfb951825ef8b1d555a59",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "ebc8c3fbc886969befb6be18d4f85787de29b086",
          "git_sha": "8516fd8b7afbab3a6fce21e20612d01f94c0b83b",
          "line_end": 45,
          "line_start": 39,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "codefuse-ai/codefuse-muagent",
          "url": "https://github.com/codefuse-ai/CodeFuse-muAgent/blob/ebc8c3fbc886969befb6be18d4f85787de29b086/README.md#L39-L45"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_e9f7998890357d38248abb4de93fa48d54b3f94eb9bbcd01822c794cd014accd"
      ],
      "text": "Users orchestrate agents through canvas-based drag-and-drop and simple text writing, with the LLM executing complex SOPs under human guidance."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_0957292716fbfa0ed79f9df4a5384a34861addb1603ce3c3d9353ac9adf2ff83",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "ebc8c3fbc886969befb6be18d4f85787de29b086",
          "git_sha": "8516fd8b7afbab3a6fce21e20612d01f94c0b83b",
          "line_end": 96,
          "line_start": 91,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "codefuse-ai/codefuse-muagent",
          "url": "https://github.com/codefuse-ai/CodeFuse-muAgent/blob/ebc8c3fbc886969befb6be18d4f85787de29b086/README.md#L91-L96"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_a0c30b268153ee835b6884a23d4ae04fddad019d5bbdd97996b6483adbac9dbc"
      ],
      "text": "The KG schema includes Intention Nodes, Workflow Nodes, Tool Nodes, and Character Nodes; Tool Nodes aim to improve tool selection and parameter filling, and Character Nodes support human-involved processes."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_86380261be28427864dcfead536753d3f9681a021ce37bfb6223d73418c92a26",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "ebc8c3fbc886969befb6be18d4f85787de29b086",
          "git_sha": "8516fd8b7afbab3a6fce21e20612d01f94c0b83b",
          "line_end": 96,
          "line_start": 91,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "codefuse-ai/codefuse-muagent",
          "url": "https://github.com/codefuse-ai/CodeFuse-muAgent/blob/ebc8c3fbc886969befb6be18d4f85787de29b086/README.md#L91-L96"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_a0c30b268153ee835b6884a23d4ae04fddad019d5bbdd97996b6483adbac9dbc"
      ],
      "text": "Advertised feature areas include an EKG Builder with intelligent parsing and one-click import of documents, EKG Reasoning under human guidance, and a Diagnose mode with visual debugging and end-to-end monitoring."
    },
